KNOWNBUG
combinational_cycle2.sv
--aig --bound 3
^\[main\.p0\] .*: PROVED up to bound 3$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The netlist converter cuts the loop with a free variable, which gives the
model traces, and p0 is refuted. Word-level BMC treats the definitions of
the nets as equations, which have no solution.
